oneOf.description:
Replay the request to the agent (same method, path, query, allowed headers and body);
a 2xx allows, any other answer is sent to the client. What a WAF reverse-proxy image
understands.

`NodePort`: a port on every node. The Gateway address is still the Service's cluster
IP, reachable only inside the cluster (`status.addresses` cannot hold a node port);
clients outside use a node's address and the node port. `rdock validate` warns.

probe_timeout.description:
`gradient` only: the longest a measurement pins the limit to `min` (default 5s;
100ms–60s). When it ends early, the median of the samples it has becomes the
reference; without any, the previous reference stays.
